      "lines": [
        "$\\frac{7}{24}+\\frac{11}{60}-\\frac{5}{36}=\\frac{7\\cdot15}{24\\cdot15}+\\frac{11\\cdot6}{60\\cdot6}-\\frac{5\\cdot10}{36\\cdot10}↵=\\frac{105+66-50}{360}=\\frac{121}{360}$."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "1081",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "1081. 把下列分数的分母化成最小公分母：",
        "1) $\\frac{7}{24}$和$\\frac{11}{36}$；　　2) $\\frac{53}{120}$和$\\frac{77}{70}$；",
        "3) $\\frac{5}{18}$，$\\frac{8}{15}$和$\\frac{13}{30}$；　　4) $\\frac{23}{70}$，$\\frac{4}{105}$和$\\frac{6}{49}$."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "1082",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "1082. 计算：",
        "1) $\\frac{7}{20}+\\frac{11}{30}$；　　2) $\\frac{8}{45}-\\frac{16}{60}$；",
        "3) $\\frac{5}{48}+\\frac{17}{36}$；　　4) $\\frac{16}{45}-\\frac{11}{30}$."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "1083",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "1083. 求下列各式的值：",
        "1) $\\frac{5}{8}+\\frac{1}{4}+\\frac{7}{12}$；　　2) $\\frac{5}{6}-\\frac{3}{8}+\\frac{1}{12}$；",
        "3) $\\frac{3}{7}+\\frac{11}{14}-\\frac{2}{21}$；　　4) $\\frac{1}{5}+\\frac{1}{7}-\\frac{1}{9}$."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "1084",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "1084. 计算：",
        "1) $3\\frac{5}{8}-\\frac{3}{4}+2\\frac{7}{12}$；　2) $4\\frac{3}{4}+1\\frac{7}{12}-2\\frac{4}{9}$."
      ]
    },
